      "updated": 1773949716232,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Requirements\n\n1. Functional Requirements\n- Gather candidate information - (resume, AI interviews)\n- Search for suitable candidates based on the job requirements\n\n2. Non-functional Requiremtns\n- consistency >> avaialibility\n- low latency matching system (<300ms)\n- scalable to support 1million users and 100k DAU\n\n3. Core Entities\n- User\n- JobForm\n- Match\n - Job\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Requirements\n\n1. Functional Requirements\n- Gather candidate information - (resume, AI interviews)\n- Search for suitable candidates based on the job requirements\n\n2. Non-functional Requiremtns\n- consistency >> avaialibility\n- low latency matching system (<300ms)\n- scalable to support 1million users and 100k DAU\n\n3. Core Entities\n- User\n- JobForm\n- Match\n - Job\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
